---Describes an autoscaling policy for Dataproc cluster autoscaler.
---@class gcp.dataproc_v1.AutoscalingPolicy
---@field id? string Required. The policy id.The id must contain only letters (a-z, A-Z), numbers (0-9), underscores (_), and hyphens (-). Cannot begin or end with underscore or hyphen. Must consist of between 3 and 50 characters.
---@field basicAlgorithm? gcp.dataproc_v1.BasicAutoscalingAlgorithm
---@field name? string Output only. The "resource name" of the autoscaling policy, as described in https://cloud.google.com/apis/design/resource_names. For projects.regions.autoscalingPolicies, the resource name of the policy has the following format: projects/{project_id}/regions/{region}/autoscalingPolicies/{policy_id} For projects.locations.autoscalingPolicies, the resource name of the policy has the following format: projects/{project_id}/locations/{location}/autoscalingPolicies/{policy_id}
---@field secondaryWorkerConfig? gcp.dataproc_v1.InstanceGroupAutoscalingPolicyConfig Optional. Describes how the autoscaler will operate for secondary workers.
---@field workerConfig? gcp.dataproc_v1.InstanceGroupAutoscalingPolicyConfig Required. Describes how the autoscaler will operate for primary workers.
---@field labels? gcp.dataproc_v1.StringMap Optional. The labels to associate with this autoscaling policy. Label keys must contain 1 to 63 characters, and must conform to RFC 1035 (https://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc1035.txt). Label values may be empty, but, if present, must contain 1 to 63 characters, and must conform to RFC 1035 (https://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc1035.txt). No more than 32 labels can be associated with an autoscaling policy.
---@field clusterType? gcp.dataproc_v1.AutoscalingPolicyClusterTypeEnum Optional. The type of the clusters for which this autoscaling policy is to be configured.

---@alias gcp.dataproc_v1.AutoscalingPolicyClusterTypeEnum "CLUSTER_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"STANDARD"|"ZERO_SCALE"

