---@field jarFileUris? gcp.dataproc_v1.StringList Optional. HCFS URIs of jar files to add to the CLASSPATHs of the Flink driver and tasks.
---@field loggingConfig? gcp.dataproc_v1.LoggingConfig Optional. The runtime log config for job execution.
