---@field config? gcp.dataproc_v1.GkeNodeConfig Optional. The node pool configuration.

---GKE node pools that Dataproc workloads run on.
---@class gcp.dataproc_v1.GkeNodePoolTarget
---@field nodePoolConfig? gcp.dataproc_v1.GkeNodePoolConfig Input only. The configuration for the GKE node pool.If specified, Dataproc attempts to create a node pool with the specified shape. If one with the same name already exists, it is verified against all specified fields. If a field differs, the virtual cluster creation will fail.If omitted, any node pool with the specified name is used. If a node pool with the specified name does not exist, Dataproc create a node pool with default values.This is an input only field. It will not be returned by the API.
---@field nodePool? string Required. The target GKE node pool. Format: 'projects/{project}/locations/{location}/clusters/{cluster}/nodePools/{node_pool}'
---@field roles? gcp.dataproc_v1.GkeNodePoolTargetRolesItemEnumList Required. The roles associated with the GKE node pool.

