---@field instanceSelectionList? gcp.dataproc_v1.InstanceSelectionList Optional. List of instance selection options that the group will use when creating new VMs.
---@field instanceMachineTypes? gcp.dataproc_v1.StringMap Output only. A map of instance short name to machine type. The key is the short name of the Compute Engine instance, and the value is the full machine-type name (e.g., 'n1-standard-16'). See Machine types for more information on valid machine type strings.
