---@field standardCapacityPercentAboveBase? number Optional. The percentage of target capacity that should use Standard VM. The remaining percentage will use Spot VMs. The percentage applies only to the capacity above standard_capacity_base. eg. If 15 instances are requested and standard_capacity_base is 5 and standard_capacity_percent_above_base is 30, the service will create 5 standard VMs and then start mixing spot and standard VMs for remaining 10 instances. The mix will be 30% standard and 70% spot.

